chapter.v:
	Nevertheless these 

	 you shall not eat among those that chew the cud or those that have cloven hooves: the camel, because it chews the cud but does not have cloven hooves, is unclean to you;
 [Acts 10:14]

	‘These also 

	 shall be unclean to you among the creeping things that creep on the earth: the mole, the mouse, and the large lizard after its kind;
 [Is. 66:17]
